      *  HYLSSCC9 - Joins HYPSSCC + HYPSCWK (mirror of HYLSSCC8 keyed on
      *  pallet serial SCPSRL#).
     A          R HYRSSCC                   PFILE(HYPSSCC)
      *
     A          K SCPSRL#
      *
     A          R HYRSCWK                   PFILE(HYPSCWK)
      *
     A          K S1PSRL#
